usage: kernelet-eval [-h] {check-config,run,perf-sym,profile} ...

positional arguments:
  {check-config,run,perf-sym,profile}
    check-config        Validate Linux .config against perf guard
    run                 Run shuffled multi-round evaluation across L/A/K
    perf-sym            Synthesize combined guestkallsyms for perf kvm
    profile             Synthesize guestkallsyms and run host perf kvm record

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
